# Wide characters and clusters: a word of wide characters selects whole, a
# drag that ends on a wide character's second cell takes the character
# once, and a cluster copies whole.
# spec: ADR-1003, the selection; INTERFACE-vtium.md, The selection and copy
# covers: clipboard.selection
size 12 2
send "中文 e\u{301}x 😀!"
select word at 1,0
copy
select word at 5,0
copy
select start at 0,0
select to at 9,0
copy
select word at 9,0
copy
dump frame
